  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Neighbourhood policing, Serious Organised Crime Agency, tougher penalties, ID cards/biometric borders, robust anti-terror laws; NATO at core of defence and retention of an independent nuclear deterrent; fiscal rules with a 2% inflation target; points-based migration favouring skills; “rights matched by responsibilities,” back-to-work reforms and making work pay; NHS investment/tripled spending, smoke-free workplaces, healthier school meals; Single Equality Act and Commission on Equality and Human Rights. TEXT_C: Oppose ID cards; cut defence spending and decommission nuclear weapons; disestablish the Church and curb royal powers; restorative justice and treating drugs as a health issue; universal, non-withdrawable Citizen’s Income and Citizen’s Pension; strong anti-GM/organics target, zero waste, animal welfare; progressive taxation, LVT, and PR/written constitution.",
